 "text": "-->\nShawnee Feed and Grain - About: Grain Marketing\n-->\nAbout: Grain Marketing\nToggle Navigation\nLogin\nOpen an Account\nContact Us\nMarket Center\nHome\nAbout\nAbout Us\nGrain Marketing\nLocations\nMarket Information\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nOptions\nCharts\nMarket Heat Maps\nAg News\nFinancial News\nUSDA Reports\nUSDA NASS\nAg Calendar\nOur Products\nLivestock Feed\nPet Food\nEquine Feed\nHog Feed\nPoultry Feed\nSheep & Goat Feed\nWildlife Feed\nSpecialty Feed\nDealer Locator\n-->\nGrain Marketing\nSince 1906 Shawnee Milling Company has been enriching generations with products your family can trust. That all starts with quality grain and a relationship with the farmers who produce it. After your crop is produced, our hope is that we can provide you with a good option for marketing your grain; adding value to your efforts. As a partner in agriculture, we are aware of the challenges you face in producing a quality crop efficiently and profitably.\nThe Shawnee Milling Grain Team works hard to bring you a variety of contracting options. For more details, please contact the Grain Team at the mill to discuss which options may be best for you!\nCall 405-273-7000 x4 to reach a member of the Grain Team.\nMarketing Options 2020 Wheat Quality Program\n-->\nTHERE IS SUBSTANTIAL RISK OF LOSS IN TRADING FUTURES AND OPTIONS; THEREFORE YOU SHOULD CAREFULLY CONSIDER WHETHER TRADING IS APPROPRIATE FOR YOU IN THE LIGHT OF YOUR FINANCIAL SITUATION.\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation, site analysis, and Barchart's marketing. Data sharing with social media platforms might occur based on the privacy choices you make on those platforms. For specifics, see our our Privacy Policy .\nAccept",
